 end="0:32.040">matter</span> <span begin="0:32.040" end="0:32.195">of</span> <span begin="0:32.195" end="0:32.481">time</span> <span begin="0:32.481" end="0:32.731">before</span> <span begin="0:32.731" end="0:32.945">we</span> <span begin="0:32.945" end="0:33.146">all</span> <span begin="0:33.146" end="0:33.473">run</span> <span begin="0:33.473" end="0:33.881">out</span></p><p begin="0:34.079" end="0:36.387" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:34.079" end="0:34.216">When</span> <span begin="0:34.216" end="0:34.317">I</span> <span begin="0:34.317" end="0:34.543">thought</span> <span begin="0:34.543" end="0:34.668">he</span> <span begin="0:34.668" end="0:34.871">was</span> <span begin="0:34.871" end="0:35.151">mine,</span> <span begin="0:35.151" end="0:35.389">she</span> <span begin="0:35.389" end="0:35.573">caught</span> <span begin="0:35.573" end="0:35.752">him</span> <span begin="0:35.752" end="0:35.954">by</span> <span begin="0:35.954" end="0:36.115">the</span> <span begin="0:36.115" end="0:36.387">mouth</span></p><p begin="0:36.508" end="0:39.328" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:36.508" end="0:36.847">I</span> <span begin="0:36.847" end="0:37.185">waited</span> <span begin="0:37.185" end="0:37.399">eight</span> <span begin="0:37.399" end="0:37.716">long</span> <span begin="0:37.716" end="0:38.079">months,</span> <span begin="0:38.079" end="0:38.244">she</span> <span begin="0:38.244" end="0:38.530">finally</span> <span begin="0:38.530" end="0:38.828">set</span> <span begin="0:38.828" end="0:39.042">him</span> <span begin="0:39.042" end="0:39.328">free</span></p><p begin="0:39.329" end="0:42.244" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:39.329" end="0:39.643">I</span> <span begin="0:39.643" end="0:39.835">told</span> <span begin="0:39.835" end="0:40.036">him</span> <span begin="0:40.036" end="0:40.220">I</span> <span begin="0:40.220" end="0:40.530">couldn't</span> <span begin="0:40.530" end="0:40.709">lie,</span> <span begin="0:40.762" end="0:40.893">he</span> <span begin="0:40.893" end="0:41.054">was</span> <span begin="0:41.054" end="0:41.250">the</span> <span begin="0:41.250" end="0:41.601">only</span> <span begin="0:41.601" end="0:41.768">one</span> <span begin="0:41.768" end="0:41.959">for</span> <span begin="0:41.959" end="0:42.244">me</span></p><p begin="0:42.338" end="0:44.396" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.338" end="0:42.677">Two</span> <span begin="0:42.677" end="0:42.945">weeks</span> <span begin="0:42.945" end="0:43.058">and</span> <span begin="0:43.058" end="0:43.374">we</span> <span begin="0:43.374" end="0:43.659">caught</span> <span begin="0:43.659" end="0:43.892">on</span> <span begin="0:43.892" end="0:44.396">fire</span></p><p begin="0:44.399" end="0:47.328" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:44.399" end="0:44.619">She's</span> <span begin="0:44.619" end="0:44.738">got</span> <span begin="0:44.738" end="0:44.838">it</span> <span begin="0:44.838" end="0:45.066">out</span> <span begin="0:45.066" end="0:45.310">for</span> <span begin="0:45.310" end="0:45.566">me,</span> <span begin="0:45.566" end="0:45.665">but</span> <span begin="0:45.665" end="0:45.881">I</span> <span begin="0:45.881" end="0:46.048">wear</span> <span begin="0:46.048" end="0:46.237">the</span> <span begin="0:46.237" end="0:46.820">biggest</span> <span begin="0:46.820" end="0:47.328">smile</span></p><p begin="0:50.481" end="0:53.945" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:50.481" end="0:51.814">Whoa,</span> <span begin="0:51.814" end="0:51.968">I</span> <span begin="0:51.968" end="0:52.243">never</span> <span begin="0:52.243" end="0:52.529">meant</span> <span begin="0:52.529" end="0:52.975">to</span> <span begin="0:52.975" end="0:53.945">brag</span></p><p begin="0:54.048" end="0:56.162" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:54.048" end="0:54.381">But</span> <span begin="0:54.381" end="0:54.561">I</span> <span begin="0:54.561" end="0:54.780">got</span> <span begin="0:54.780" end="0:54.905">him</span> <span begin="0:54.905" end="0:55.084">where</span> <span begin="0:55.084" end="0:55